{"3313430": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Spectral Sonata", "steam_appid": 3313430, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/c9d64de00679bab9e1e7698cfd6254e4.avif?t=1783688138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras_big/c9d64de00679bab9e1e7698cfd6254e4.avif?t=1783688138 width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectral Sonata</strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience set in a grand, decaying estate. As you navigate the shifting corridors, you uncover fragments of a tragic story tied to a prodigious musician whose presence still lingers within the house. The mansion subtly rearranges itself as you progress, revealing new passages, hidden rooms, and unsettling memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.poster.avif?t=1783688138\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.webm?t=1783688138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.mp4?t=1783688138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting melodies echo through the halls, sometimes offering guidance, other times signaling imminent danger. Piece together the past by discovering scattered notes, forgotten memories, and environmental clues. Your actions and understanding of the tragedy dictate your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape the mansion’s grasp, drive the spirit away, or finally set its soul free?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.poster.avif?t=1783688138\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.webm?t=1783688138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.mp4?t=1783688138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension:</strong> A slow-burn experience built on tension, unease, and anticipation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Exploration:</strong> Explore a dynamic environment where the layout shifts as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound-Driven Gameplay:</strong> Music and ambient audio guide, warn, and shape the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Uncover the narrative through notes, memories, and subtle visual details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> The conclusion is determined by your actions and understanding of the story.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/c9d64de00679bab9e1e7698cfd6254e4.avif?t=1783688138\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras_big/c9d64de00679bab9e1e7698cfd6254e4.avif?t=1783688138 width=800 height=44 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectral Sonata</strong> is a first-person psychological horror experience set in a grand, decaying estate. As you navigate the shifting corridors, you uncover fragments of a tragic story tied to a prodigious musician whose presence still lingers within the house. The mansion subtly rearranges itself as you progress, revealing new passages, hidden rooms, and unsettling memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.poster.avif?t=1783688138\" width=800 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.webm?t=1783688138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/374c487023ef5ccc6958d38c03a3bc29.mp4?t=1783688138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Haunting melodies echo through the halls, sometimes offering guidance, other times signaling imminent danger. Piece together the past by discovering scattered notes, forgotten memories, and environmental clues. Your actions and understanding of the tragedy dictate your fate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will you escape the mansion’s grasp, drive the spirit away, or finally set its soul free?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.poster.avif?t=1783688138\" width=800 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.webm?t=1783688138\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/extras/e0cc9f2a3c6b2bad1fac7604598c14e9.mp4?t=1783688138\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Tension:</strong> A slow-burn experience built on tension, unease, and anticipation.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Exploration:</strong> Explore a dynamic environment where the layout shifts as you progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Sound-Driven Gameplay:</strong> Music and ambient audio guide, warn, and shape the experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Environmental Storytelling:</strong> Uncover the narrative through notes, memories, and subtle visual details.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings:</strong> The conclusion is determined by your actions and understanding of the story.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A first person psychological horror game. Explore an ever-changing mansion in a slow-paced, atmospheric experience that combines hauntingly beautiful melodies with a suffocating environment. Uncover the tragic past, escape or confront the spirit.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Romanian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/380656390ac79798b056bd28ec39519efaff4747/header.jpg?t=1783688138", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/09c9dfad60acd02990cfdadf137ee55a8c794663/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1783688138", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/09c9dfad60acd02990cfdadf137ee55a8c794663/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1783688138", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8300H or AMD Ryzen 3 2200U<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 Ti (4GB) or AMD Radeon RX 560<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game includes graphics settings to aid lower end devices.</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400 / AMD Ryzen 5 3600 or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 12 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> The game includes graphics settings to aid lower end devices.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Feeric Studio"], "publishers": ["Feeric Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 13, "description": "Captions available"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 75, "description": "Keyboard Only Option"}, {"id": 76, "description": "Mouse Only Option"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 65, "description": "Subtitle Options"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 61, "description": "HDR available"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}, {"id": "23", "description": "Indie"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3313430/ba7f8b060258bb51569459d68fbaea44b38e79f1/ss_ba7f8b060258b